Regardless of perspective, Siamorphe's faith remains closely connected to the Upper City's political culture.
''';

const String tymora = '''
Tymora, goddess of good fortune, enjoys immense popularity throughout Baldur's Gate.

Adventurers, sailors, gamblers, merchants, and risk-takers frequently offer prayers in hopes of favorable outcomes.

