const String dangersInBaldursGate = '''
Opportunity and danger exist side by side throughout Baldur's Gate.

Political corruption, organized crime, cult activity, violent gangs, and supernatural threats constantly challenge the city's stability.

Many dangers remain hidden behind respectable appearances. Wealthy merchants may secretly fund criminal operations, religious organizations may conceal dark agendas, and public officials may pursue private ambitions.

